  <!-- Main Text-Based Policy Content -->
  <div class="ga-shipping-content-block" style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto 6rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem;">
    
    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">1. Trusted Logistics Partners</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        We primarily use leading national carriers such as <strong>Delhivery, Blue Dart, DTDC, Ecom Express &amp; XpressBees</strong>. <strong>Ekart</strong> and <strong>Amazon Shipping Surface</strong> may be used for select locations based on serviceability. The courier selected for an individual shipment may vary based on destination, serviceability, package characteristics, availability, and operational conditions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">2. Order Processing &amp; Pickup</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        We generally initiate the shipment/pickup process within <strong>24 hours</strong> of a successful order (in some cases, pickup is generated within only a few hours). Because Ghar Aangan operates from Uttarakhand and some operating locations are relatively remote, courier partners may sometimes take additional time to reach our pickup location. Pickup time can therefore be longer than the usual 24-hour expectation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">3. Delivery Timelines</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        We dispatch orders within <strong>24 hours</strong>. Domestic delivery timelines across India are:
      </p>
      <ul style="list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 1rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-sans); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--ga-dark-text);">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-forest-green);">⚡</span>
          <strong>Fast Delivery (Prepaid Orders):</strong> Delivered in <strong>5 to 6 business days</strong> across India with <strong>FREE Express Shipping</strong>.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-forest-green);">📦</span>
          <strong>Standard Shipping (Cash on Delivery):</strong> Delivered in <strong>7 to 10 business days</strong> across India (standard ₹100 fee applies). <em>Note: COD is available on 550ml and 1L packs. Bulk and family packs (2 Litres and 5 Litres) are strictly Prepaid Only.</em>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">4. Possible Delivery Delays</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Delays may occur because of vehicle accidents, road blocks, landslides, severe weather, natural events, courier operational issues, network congestion, major festivals, public holidays, address/PIN-code issues, customer unavailability, or other unforeseen circumstances. We will make reasonable efforts to follow up with the logistics partner when a delay is reported.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">5. Express Delivery Options</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Ghar Aangan may offer <strong>Express Priority Delivery</strong> for selected orders and serviceable locations, including selected metro and Delhi/NCR regions. Such faster delivery may require the order to be prepaid. Availability, charges, and estimated timelines depend on serviceability and operational availability.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 6 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">6. Shipping Charges</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        Under normal circumstances, Ghar Aangan generally charges approximately <strong>₹100 per domestic delivery</strong>. The actual charge can vary by state, city/PIN code, package characteristics, courier service, and active promotions.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        We may offer free shipping on selected products, minimum order values, or festive promotions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 7 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">7. Packaging: Glass &amp; Steel</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Our <strong>550 ml, 1 litre, and 2 litre</strong> ghee products are packed in glass jars. Our <strong>5 litre</strong> ghee product is packed in a steel Dolchi. Glass is delicate, so we use protective packaging and take reasonable care while preparing every shipment. However, courier handling is outside our direct control.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 8 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">8. Tracking &amp; Address Accuracy</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        <strong>Tracking:</strong> After the courier shipment is generated and picked up, tracking information is available through SMS/email notifications and the courier tracking portal. Courier scans can occasionally update with a delay or show an estimated status that later changes. If tracking appears stuck or unusual, contact us and we will follow up.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        <strong>Address &amp; RTO:</strong> Customers are responsible for providing a complete and accurate delivery address, PIN code, and contact number. Incorrect/incomplete details or unavailability can cause delays, failed attempts, or Return to Origin (RTO). Customers should reasonably remain available for delivery calls.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 9 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">9. International Delivery &amp; Payment</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        Ghar Aangan now delivers authentic Himalayan purity to customers worldwide across <strong>10 destination countries</strong>: <strong>United States (USA), United Kingdom (UK), Australia, Canada, Germany, United Arab Emirates (UAE), France, New Zealand, Switzerland, and Singapore</strong>.
      </p>
      <ul style="list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 1rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-sans); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--ga-dark-text);">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-forest-green);">✈️</span>
          <strong>Delivery Fee:</strong> Flat <strong>₹2,499 INR</strong> per international order.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-forest-green);">💳</span>
          <strong>Payment Mode:</strong> <strong>Prepaid Orders Only</strong>. We accept all major <strong>International Credit &amp; Debit Cards</strong> (Visa, Mastercard, American Express, etc.) via secure checkout. Cash on Delivery (COD) is strictly unavailable for international orders.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-forest-green);">⏱️</span>
          <strong>Estimated Delivery Time (International Express Shipping):</strong> <strong>15 to 25 business days</strong> via international express air couriers (DHL Express / FedEx / Aramex / India Post EMS) directly from Uttarakhand.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-forest-green);">🛡️</span>
          <strong>Packaging &amp; Customs:</strong> Multi-layer shockproof export packaging to ensure transit safety. Any customs duties or import taxes levied by the destination country are the recipient's responsibility as per international trade regulations.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 10 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">10. Cash on Delivery (COD) Policy</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        <strong>Yes, Cash on Delivery (COD) is available</strong> for our 550ml and 1 Litre packs across serviceable pin codes in India (7 to 10 business days, standard ₹100 fee applies). <strong>Please Note:</strong> Due to courier weight and transit handling, our bulk packs (<strong>2 Litres and 5 Litres</strong>) are eligible for <strong>Prepaid Orders Only</strong> (UPI, Credit/Debit Cards, Netbanking) and enjoy <strong>100% FREE Express Shipping</strong> directly from Uttarakhand.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

